# SCPN Z-Pinch Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Z-Pinch Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the z-pinch and sheared-flow
  z-pinch configurations within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group.
  Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated device
  configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN
  Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0 device physics
  (Bennett equilibrium, ideal-MHD growth estimates with the Kadomtsev
  criterion, the Shumlak-Hartman sheared-flow criterion and the
  Pease-Braginskii current), and tessellated and B-rep device models with
  STL, glTF and STEP exports. All parameter sets are synthetic; no real
  machine is described, and the claim inventory is empty.
